1
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:40,280
You…

2
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,800
…killed my father.

3
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,240
You…

4
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:48,880
…are not my friend.

5
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,720
You are not my friend either.

6
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:59,840
(The parliament is reaching
the end of its term.)

7
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:04,320
(The government is preparing to hold
a general election in the next three months.)

8
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:09,560
(The election will be held on
the 25th Buddhist Century Anniversary.)

9
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:16,960
(The prime minister pledges
to hold a fair and transparent election)

10
00:04:17,240 --> 00:04:19,440
(to celebrate the special occasion.)

11
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,080
Stop.
Hey, stop.

12
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:30,280
What’s going on?

13
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:33,680
You want to try me.
Come on.

14
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,360
Bring it on.

15
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:38,320
Please don’t hurt me.

16
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,320
Hey! Stop it.

17
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,080
I don’t know
what the hell is going on between you guys.

18
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:13,120
But you are a real loser
for beating up the kid.

19
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:14,920
Who the hell are you?

20
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,280
This is none of your f*cking business.

21
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,960
I’m your daddy.

22
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:25,920
Kiddo.

23
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,720
You can go now.

24
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:05,560
Great!

25
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,560
Amazing.

26
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:08,960
Awesome.

27
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,240
How dare you beat up a boy!

28
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,040
Your parents send you to school,

29
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,360
but you don’t study.

30
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,760
Don’t ever dare to beat up a kid again.

31
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,080
I won’t do it.

32
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:22,000
Now, you can talk to me politely?

33
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,080
Hey!

34
00:06:29,480 --> 00:06:30,480
What the hell did you do to my bro?

35
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:37,040
Now, I get to have a bit more fun.

36
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,320
Get up.

37
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,040
Kick his ass.

38
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:21,240
Get him.
What the f*ck are you waiting for?

39
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,200
I haven’t come to Thonburi for a while.

40
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:45,560
I almost don’t remember it.

41
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:05,680
These punks are fighting again.

42
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,680
All they do is cause trouble.

43
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:10,960
Don’t be scared, honey.

44
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:14,000
They fight every day.

45
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:17,600
Shit!

46
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,600
Hey.

47
00:09:11,400 --> 00:09:11,800
Come on.

48
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:12,840
Hurry up.

49
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:26,480
Faster.

50
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:50,080
Be careful.

51
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:03,440
Thanks.

52
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:34,760
Hey.

53
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:36,800
Where are you going?

54
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:41,480
Hey.

55
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,120
Where are you going?

56
00:10:46,760 --> 00:10:47,240
What’s wrong?

57
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:49,480
You don’t want to talk to me?

58
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:51,280
You don’t like me?

59
00:11:05,760 --> 00:11:06,280
Are you afraid of me?

60
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,000
No, I’m not.

61
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,160
I just don’t want to talk to a gangster.

62
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,560
You don’t like me.
Then why did you help me?

63
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:18,560
I saw you run after the bus.

64
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,320
I’m worried that you might die.

65
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:25,440
How does my hair look?

66
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:35,400
You look good.

67
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,040
Are you from around here?

68
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:49,920
You came from Phra Nakorn, didn’t you?

69
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:53,520
Are you here for work?

70
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,920
You must come to see your wife, right?

71
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,080
The area is rough.

72
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,640
Do you want my help?

73
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,560
This is to repay you for helping me earlier.

74
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:12,520
You should worry about yourself.

75
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:14,400
You almost got beaten up.

76
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:24,720
I’m getting off here.

77
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:31,600
Here.

78
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,440
Pay the bus fare for me.

79
00:12:34,920 --> 00:12:35,320
No.

80
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:39,520
Keep it. I don’t like owing people.

81
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:45,920
Thanks for helping me earlier.

82
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:56,600
Is he crazy?

83
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:01,920
THONBURI GANGSTER

84
00:13:02,840 --> 00:13:03,360
Hey!

85
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:07,680
Now you want to know me.

86
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:11,480
Is this your comb?

87
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,200
Keep it.

88
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:18,840
Hey.

89
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:20,520
Damn it.

90
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:35,600
THONBURI PROVINCIAL PRISON

91
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:15,640
URGENT SALE

92
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:20,080
This house has been vacant for a while.

93
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,560
Their son is in prison.

94
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:24,200
They were embarrassed.
So they moved away.

95
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,640
Zoe, is that you?

96
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:28,200
Hello, auntie.

97
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,640
Excuse me. I need to go home.

98
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,640
KRADAT BEAUTY SALON

99
00:14:58,640 --> 00:15:00,400
Your curls look amazing.

100
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:02,480
Let me fix this part a bit.

101
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:07,960
Next time, you should get a root perm.

102
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:09,560
I guarantee you will look modish.

103
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:12,080
My hair looks great. I love it.

104
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:13,200
I’m leaving.

105
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,480
Watch your step.

106
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:14,880
Yes.

107
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:24,720
Yong.

108
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:29,600
How have you been?

109
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:30,640
What are you doing here?

110
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:34,720
I came to the address
on the postcard you sent me.

111
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:38,480
It looks so old.
I can’t believe you still keep it.

112
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:43,800
I have a gift for you.

113
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:46,080
What is it?

114
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:47,600
You will like them.

115
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,640
They are so cute.

116
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:56,360
I’ll use them now.

117
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:04,520
One more.

118
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:09,080
How do I look?

119
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:10,440
Groovy.

120
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:14,600
What are you doing in Thonburi?

121
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:19,520
I…

122
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:25,640
This is my mom.

123
00:16:27,760 --> 00:16:29,600
I heard that she moved to Thonburi.

124
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:32,280
Have you ever seen her?

125
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,840
Chayasilpa.

126
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:56,680
Here it is.
CHAYASILPA

127
00:16:57,520 --> 00:16:58,800
Let’s ask the owner.

128
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:01,680
Hello.

129
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,360
I’m Kradat.

130
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:05,360
What’s up, Kradat?

131
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,480
Do you know the woman in the picture?

132
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:13,680
Hey.

133
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:15,440
Hey.

134
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:41,120
It’s him.

135
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:56,120
Is your wife living here?

136
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,160
I came to see the owner.

137
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:03,760
Where is he?

138
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,400
You came to harass him, didn’t you?

139
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:12,200
That’s why he quickly ran away.

140
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:15,360
You must really dislike gangsters.

141
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,240
I came to pick up the picture
that you are admiring.

142
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:35,640
So full of yourself.

143
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:46,560
Wait.

144
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:50,320
Here.

145
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,720
You dropped it on the bus.

146
00:18:53,760 --> 00:18:54,360
Take it.

147
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:57,800
I have several combs.

148
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,360
I think you need it.

149
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:08,040
If you want to have a wife,
you need to put yourself together.

150
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:10,800
Take it back.

151
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:20,080
Hey, what are you doing?

152
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:21,120
What the heck?
Stay still.

153
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:42,360
Your outfit is not bad,
but your hair is a mess.

154
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,800
Put oil on your hair. Girls like it.

155
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:54,560
Hey.

156
00:19:55,800 --> 00:19:56,840
My hair is none of your business.

157
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:59,360
I help you look decent.
Why are you against it?

158
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:00,600
I look decent.

159
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:02,360
I’m also a decent person.

160
00:20:03,400 --> 00:20:04,280
What about you?

161
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:14,960
What’s your name?

162
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:20,640
Yong. My name is Yong.

163
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:21,880
Yong.

164
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:24,000
I’ll remember it.

165
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,000
I won’t tell you my name.

166
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:31,960
If you want to know, you can ask around.

167
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:42,560
What the hell is wrong with him?

168
00:20:46,880 --> 00:20:47,600
I didn’t say anything.

169
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:01,320
Come and help me.

170
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:03,120
KLOOKFOON GANG,
PHRA NAKORN PROVINCE

171
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:05,640
Are there three bottles of booze in the box?

172
00:21:06,960 --> 00:21:07,680
Yes, they are all here.

173
00:21:08,760 --> 00:21:09,160
Okay.

174
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:11,320
Din, the fuzz is here.

175
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:12,480
Hello, officer.

176
00:21:13,160 --> 00:21:13,960
What’s up?

177
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,040
Can I search your warehouse?

178
00:21:16,600 --> 00:21:17,000
Go.

179
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,160
You, search there.

180
00:21:19,280 --> 00:21:20,320
Let them search.

181
00:21:40,840 --> 00:21:41,840
These goods are smuggled in.

182
00:21:42,320 --> 00:21:43,360
They don’t match the records.

183
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:45,960
Seize these goods.

184
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,760
You can’t take them.

185
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:49,960
Officer, can’t you wait until Zeng gets here?

186
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:52,840
Why do I need to wait for him?

187
00:21:54,360 --> 00:21:55,320
Put it back.

188
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,760
Calm down.

189
00:21:58,720 --> 00:21:59,400
Put it down.

190
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:00,520
Calm down.

191
00:22:34,720 --> 00:22:35,320
Put it back.
Move.

192
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:36,720
Din.

193
00:22:48,280 --> 00:22:49,080
Can we talk over there?

194
00:22:57,120 --> 00:22:58,680
The goods just came in yesterday.

195
00:22:59,760 --> 00:23:02,160
My boys haven’t had time to check them.

196
00:23:05,560 --> 00:23:06,560
Can you let it slide for once?

197
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:12,400
Din and Kheow are released on bail.

198
00:23:12,560 --> 00:23:15,280
Bail paper for Hoi will be ready tomorrow.

199
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:17,280
So he will spend tonight in jail.

200
00:23:21,480 --> 00:23:24,960
Five-O is a bit strict with sin goods these days.

201
00:23:25,840 --> 00:23:26,800
We need to be more careful.

202
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:27,760
Yes, boss.

203
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:32,440
You never abandon your men.

204
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:38,480
You are exactly like your father, Suea Yai.

205
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:41,240
That’s why I like you.

206
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:46,400
Without your dad and you,
the dock and the warehouse business

207
00:23:47,840 --> 00:23:49,640
wouldn’t have grown this big.

208
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:54,240
From now on, the dock will be packed
with ships every day.

209
00:23:57,080 --> 00:23:59,120
I just work hard to repay your kindness.

210
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:05,320
Boss, about the warehouse…

211
00:24:07,240 --> 00:24:07,680
Right.

212
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:09,760
Don’t worry.

213
00:24:13,280 --> 00:24:15,400
I owed your father a lot.

214
00:24:17,280 --> 00:24:20,520
The promise I gave to your dad,
I will never forget it.

215
00:24:23,440 --> 00:24:25,040
Three months from now, after the election.

216
00:24:27,120 --> 00:24:29,400
I will transfer the warehouse ownership to you.

217
00:24:30,680 --> 00:24:31,440
After the election?

218
00:24:35,080 --> 00:24:35,840
Really?

219
00:24:37,520 --> 00:24:38,320
Yes.

220
00:24:39,560 --> 00:24:40,400
You don’t need to worry.

221
00:24:42,760 --> 00:24:43,840
I’m not worried, boss.

222
00:24:46,320 --> 00:24:47,280
I didn’t expect it.

223
00:24:47,560 --> 00:24:48,560
If you’d be so kind,

224
00:24:50,160 --> 00:24:51,240
I’d be happy to accept it.

225
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:53,560
Goodbye.

226
00:24:54,560 --> 00:24:55,120
Bye.

227
00:24:59,080 --> 00:24:59,800
Damn.

228
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:05,280
Hey, Zeng.

229
00:25:34,600 --> 00:25:35,200
Guys.

230
00:25:40,200 --> 00:25:41,880
Three months from now.

231
00:25:43,360 --> 00:25:44,240
After the election.

232
00:25:44,880 --> 00:25:45,560
This place,

233
00:25:46,840 --> 00:25:47,920
it will be ours.

234
00:25:50,280 --> 00:25:52,320
You guys will have a salary.

235
00:25:52,760 --> 00:25:54,160
You will no longer need to collect debts for others.

236
00:25:54,440 --> 00:25:57,360
The villagers hate us to the guts already.

237
00:25:58,640 --> 00:25:59,320
Do you mean it?
Yes.

238
00:26:02,080 --> 00:26:02,680
Today,

239
00:26:04,600 --> 00:26:06,360
I don’t take the money from work.

240
00:26:07,080 --> 00:26:07,560
Din.

241
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:09,760
Take the money and give it to everyone.

242
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:12,520
Buy food and drinks and celebrate together.

243
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:16,720
Gather around.

244
00:26:18,280 --> 00:26:18,880
Take it.

245
00:26:20,840 --> 00:26:21,880
I’m so freaking cool.

246
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:35,560
Hey.

247
00:26:37,080 --> 00:26:37,720
Where is Yong?

248
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:46,760
Kradat.

249
00:26:48,120 --> 00:26:49,040
What happened to your wrist?

250
00:26:50,480 --> 00:26:54,160
I fell while I ran after the photo studio owner.

251
00:26:55,840 --> 00:26:56,600
I’m sorry.

252
00:26:57,600 --> 00:26:58,400
It’s my fault.

253
00:26:58,480 --> 00:27:00,240
It’s not a big deal.

254
00:27:01,240 --> 00:27:02,960
He probably ran away from a debt collector.

255
00:27:03,040 --> 00:27:05,800
We can ask the locals about your mom.

256
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:07,440
I’m sure we will get some news about her.

257
00:27:16,360 --> 00:27:20,680
Do you know anyone
who is well-connected in Thonburi?

258
00:27:21,560 --> 00:27:22,920
Well-connected?

259
00:27:24,320 --> 00:27:25,400
Hongsen Gaoyod.

260
00:27:27,560 --> 00:27:28,160
Who?

261
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:31,480
Hongsen Gaoyod.

262
00:27:34,320 --> 00:27:35,000
Who?

263
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:42,480
Hongsen Gaoyod.

264
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,080
I see.

265
00:27:46,600 --> 00:27:47,800
Hongsen Gaoyod.

266
00:27:48,840 --> 00:27:49,400
Who?

267
00:27:51,040 --> 00:27:52,000
I’m kidding.

268
00:27:55,800 --> 00:27:56,480
Doesn’t it hurt?

269
00:28:01,440 --> 00:28:02,640
Hongsen Gaoyod?

270
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:09,080
GAOYOD GANG, THONBURI PROVINCE
(HONGSEN GARAGE)

271
00:28:09,080 --> 00:28:11,280
(HONGSEN GARAGE)

272
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:13,120
Come on, Sen.

273
00:28:14,560 --> 00:28:15,480
He wants to leave our gang.

274
00:28:15,600 --> 00:28:16,480
You should have scolded him.

275
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:18,320
Instead, you gave him money to start a new life.

276
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:19,800
How are you going to feed our gang?

277
00:28:26,600 --> 00:28:27,040
Den.

278
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,080
Can I borrow 20 baht?

279
00:28:35,480 --> 00:28:36,520
Damn, Sen.

280
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,360
Why did you give him the money?

281
00:28:39,320 --> 00:28:41,680
If someone wants to leave our gang,
you just let them go.

282
00:28:42,120 --> 00:28:43,880
We barely have anyone left in the gang.

283
00:28:51,440 --> 00:28:51,880
Aod.

284
00:28:52,800 --> 00:28:53,360
Thanks a lot.

285
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,840
Why are you pushing the bike?

286
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:58,520
They punctured the tires.

287
00:29:03,520 --> 00:29:04,560
Aren’t you going to do anything about it?

288
00:29:06,920 --> 00:29:07,360
Sen.

289
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:09,800
Are you really going to retire from the game?

290
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:13,400
Yes.

291
00:29:18,120 --> 00:29:19,280
Before I do that, I need to find out

292
00:29:20,520 --> 00:29:25,320
who the hell killed Suea Yai and framed me.

293
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:16,400
Come on, Dad.

294
00:30:23,520 --> 00:30:24,280
Let’s celebrate.

295
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:35,240
After the election,

296
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:39,960
Boss Aang will give me the warehouse.

297
00:30:42,880 --> 00:30:44,880
I will have a business
to take care of my subordinates.

298
00:30:46,080 --> 00:30:47,240
Just like you wanted.

299
00:30:49,920 --> 00:30:50,840
Are you happy?

300
00:30:53,120 --> 00:30:54,000
Come on, Dad.

301
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:56,080
Let’s clink our glasses.

302
00:31:00,320 --> 00:31:01,520
Why don’t you drink it?

303
00:31:02,520 --> 00:31:03,880
It’s not fun to drink alone.

304
00:31:20,040 --> 00:31:20,920
Wait a little bit longer, Dad.

305
00:31:24,160 --> 00:31:24,880
No matter what,

306
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:29,240
I will drag Hongsen here to apologize to you.

307
00:32:00,800 --> 00:32:01,320
Hey.

308
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:03,680
That’s my drink.

309
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:05,080
No, it’s my drink.

310
00:32:06,120 --> 00:32:07,360
This is my damn drink.

311
00:32:07,480 --> 00:32:08,400
You drank my drink.

312
00:32:08,840 --> 00:32:09,880
No, I didn’t.

313
00:32:10,320 --> 00:32:11,840
I saw you drink it.

314
00:32:12,080 --> 00:32:13,720
If you wanted to drink it,
you could have just asked.

315
00:32:13,720 --> 00:32:14,840
I didn’t want your drink.

316
00:32:14,840 --> 00:32:16,440
This is my drink. I saw you drink it.

317
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:17,280
I told you I didn’t drink it.
I saw it.

318
00:32:17,800 --> 00:32:18,160
Hey!

319
00:32:19,240 --> 00:32:20,000
Other people are watching the movie.

320
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:21,600
If you want to argue,
go do it somewhere else.

321
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:34,120
What color is your drink?

322
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:35,680
Red.

323
00:32:36,120 --> 00:32:37,080
Look.

324
00:32:38,240 --> 00:32:38,680
What color is it?

325
00:32:42,320 --> 00:32:42,840
Is it clear?

326
00:32:44,760 --> 00:32:46,280
Can’t you tell the difference
between red and green?

327
00:32:49,040 --> 00:32:49,680
Wait a sec.
What?

328
00:32:55,400 --> 00:32:56,160
Can I have one green drink?

329
00:32:58,120 --> 00:32:59,080
He drank it all.

330
00:33:05,320 --> 00:33:06,440
Here. Are we cool now?

331
00:33:08,280 --> 00:33:08,680
No.

332
00:33:10,600 --> 00:33:12,760
Do you think you could buy me another one
and it would be over?

333
00:33:14,520 --> 00:33:15,240
You won’t accept it, right?
No.

334
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:18,400
Fine.

335
00:33:30,280 --> 00:33:30,960
Are we done now?

336
00:33:33,240 --> 00:33:33,840
Do you know…

337
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:35,440
who I am?

338
00:33:37,280 --> 00:33:39,600
Do you know who I am?

339
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:47,400
I’m Zeng Klookfoon.

340
00:33:50,440 --> 00:33:51,000
I’m…

341
00:33:52,440 --> 00:33:53,520
Zoe Tawai Waen.

342
00:33:57,240 --> 00:33:57,920
What?

343
00:34:02,360 --> 00:34:03,120
Hey.

344
00:34:04,480 --> 00:34:05,200
What the hell are you doing?

345
00:34:06,120 --> 00:34:06,800
Let me go.

346
00:34:07,320 --> 00:34:08,200
This is my wallet.

347
00:34:09,320 --> 00:34:09,920
This is mine.
It’s mine.

348
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:12,440
You are a thief.

349
00:34:12,880 --> 00:34:14,320
You not only stole my drink
but also my wallet.

350
00:34:14,800 --> 00:34:16,320
I didn’t steal your wallet.
This is my wallet.

351
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:18,280
You stole it. This is my wallet.

352
00:34:18,280 --> 00:34:19,160
It’s mine.

353
00:34:21,480 --> 00:34:23,400
What are you doing? Don’t touch my butt.

354
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:26,040
What is this?

355
00:34:35,920 --> 00:34:36,480
Whose is this?

356
00:34:38,640 --> 00:34:39,120
I…

357
00:34:40,120 --> 00:34:40,960
Why didn’t you tell me earlier?

358
00:34:41,920 --> 00:34:42,600
What the heck?!

359
00:34:43,480 --> 00:34:44,600
Give my wallet back.

360
00:34:51,720 --> 00:34:53,440
Is there anything else you want from me?

361
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:54,200
Huh?

362
00:34:57,480 --> 00:34:58,120
Zeng.

363
00:35:00,920 --> 00:35:01,600
I found Yong.

364
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:03,960
Where is he?

365
00:36:06,160 --> 00:36:07,040
Are you Kradat’s father?

366
00:36:09,240 --> 00:36:09,640
Shh!

367
00:36:10,480 --> 00:36:11,320
Yes, I’m her dad.

368
00:36:11,640 --> 00:36:12,400
Who are you?

369
00:36:15,800 --> 00:36:16,960
Are you stealing her scissors?

370
00:36:17,680 --> 00:36:19,200
I’m just borrowing them.

371
00:36:20,720 --> 00:36:21,600
If you were my son,

372
00:36:22,320 --> 00:36:23,600
would you let your father die?

373
00:36:24,240 --> 00:36:25,200
You are overreacting.

374
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:26,840
The country is governed by the rule of law.

375
00:36:28,360 --> 00:36:29,920
Do you know Hongsen Gaoyod?

376
00:36:31,960 --> 00:36:32,760
If you don’t know him,

377
00:36:33,320 --> 00:36:34,360
at least you must have heard about him.

378
00:36:35,240 --> 00:36:36,920
Go to the market and say his name.

379
00:36:37,520 --> 00:36:38,640
Even dogs are scared of him.

380
00:36:39,680 --> 00:36:41,760
Is he that scary?

381
00:36:42,440 --> 00:36:42,920
Yes.

382
00:36:43,520 --> 00:36:44,400
Wait.

383
00:36:44,640 --> 00:36:46,320
Kradat needs them to make a living.

384
00:37:05,120 --> 00:37:05,520
Den.

385
00:37:06,080 --> 00:37:06,960
Calm down.

386
00:37:07,360 --> 00:37:07,800
Hey.

387
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:10,040
Are you trying to skip out on your debt?

388
00:37:10,240 --> 00:37:10,840
No, I’m not.

389
00:37:10,840 --> 00:37:12,800
I’m going to get money to pay you back.

390
00:37:13,200 --> 00:37:14,520
Den, I’ll go get it.

391
00:37:14,840 --> 00:37:16,040
It won’t take long.

392
00:37:16,120 --> 00:37:16,680
Hurry up.

393
00:37:17,280 --> 00:37:18,760
Yes, I will.

394
00:37:26,760 --> 00:37:27,440
Hongsen!

395
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:35,160
Here. I have this.

396
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:36,680
Take it.

397
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:37,680
You can take it.

398
00:37:38,320 --> 00:37:38,720
Take it.
Hey.

399
00:37:40,560 --> 00:37:41,320
That’s mine.

400
00:37:48,200 --> 00:37:51,440
I told you to use it
to pay off your debt to Hongsen.

401
00:38:02,680 --> 00:38:03,480
You are Hongsen?

402
00:38:08,600 --> 00:38:09,120
Hey.

403
00:38:10,920 --> 00:38:11,440
Dad.

404
00:38:12,160 --> 00:38:12,680
Dad.

405
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:15,240
Sen, please let my dad go.

406
00:38:15,560 --> 00:38:17,720
I’ll pay it back,
no matter how much he owes you.

407
00:38:21,560 --> 00:38:22,320
Are you sure you want to do that?

408
00:38:22,800 --> 00:38:23,240
Yes.

409
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:26,160
Let him go.

410
00:38:27,560 --> 00:38:28,240
Take this.

411
00:38:43,240 --> 00:38:43,840
It’s not enough.

412
00:38:45,720 --> 00:38:46,120
Huh?

413
00:38:47,480 --> 00:38:48,240
How much does he owe you?

414
00:38:51,160 --> 00:38:52,560
1,500 baht.

415
00:38:59,560 --> 00:39:00,040
Sen

416
00:39:00,640 --> 00:39:01,160
Sen.

417
00:39:02,240 --> 00:39:03,200
Klookfoon Gang is here.

418
00:39:04,880 --> 00:39:05,360
Zeng.

419
00:39:10,280 --> 00:39:10,760
Zeng.

420
00:39:12,520 --> 00:39:14,080
Everyone, pack up.

421
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:16,600
Hurry up and pack everything up.

422
00:39:16,840 --> 00:39:17,840
What’s going on?

423
00:39:18,080 --> 00:39:20,320
The gangsters are going to fight here.

424
00:39:20,480 --> 00:39:21,600
Hurry up. They are here.

425
00:39:56,640 --> 00:39:57,000
Yong.

426
00:40:01,600 --> 00:40:03,360
Yong? You two know each other?

427
00:40:03,640 --> 00:40:04,320
Go take Yong here.

428
00:40:04,680 --> 00:40:05,120
Yong.
Hey.

429
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:09,680
I came here to take my man back.

430
00:40:10,200 --> 00:40:10,800
Don’t butt in.

431
00:40:13,200 --> 00:40:13,640
Butt in?

432
00:40:14,480 --> 00:40:15,440
This is my turf.

433
00:40:16,160 --> 00:40:18,160
Oh, this is your turf?

434
00:40:27,560 --> 00:40:28,040
So what?

435
00:40:31,040 --> 00:40:31,400
Move.

436
00:40:39,600 --> 00:40:40,680
If you can walk past me.

437
00:40:45,480 --> 00:40:46,960
Ever since you got out of prison,

438
00:40:48,640 --> 00:40:50,160
we haven’t had a chance
to get together for a round.

439
00:41:01,440 --> 00:41:02,160
How about now?

440
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:03,800
Hey.

441
00:41:04,320 --> 00:41:04,960
Don’t butt in.

442
00:41:08,560 --> 00:41:12,160
Don’t ever think that it is over
just because you served your time in jail.

443
00:41:12,760 --> 00:41:14,120
It’s still not over for me.

444
00:41:15,200 --> 00:41:17,320
You need to pay me for killing my father.

445
00:41:19,200 --> 00:41:20,400
What nonsense are you rambling on?

446
00:41:21,280 --> 00:41:23,880
I’m asking you: do you want to do it now?

447
00:41:31,200 --> 00:41:31,840
Asshole!

448
00:41:40,640 --> 00:41:42,520
Let’s go, Kradat. Come on.

449
00:42:09,720 --> 00:42:10,120
You!

450
00:42:49,160 --> 00:42:53,360
Do you bastards ever go a day
without making trouble?

451
00:42:54,400 --> 00:42:56,240
You brought your whole gang
from Phra Nakorn

452
00:42:56,920 --> 00:42:58,320
and scared the hell out of everyone here.

453
00:43:01,120 --> 00:43:02,120
Arrest them all!

454
00:43:03,120 --> 00:43:03,960
Follow them.

455
00:43:19,400 --> 00:43:20,880
You think you can run away from me, Zeng?

456
00:43:21,560 --> 00:43:22,120
Stop it.

457
00:43:24,320 --> 00:43:24,720
Stop it.

458
00:43:27,080 --> 00:43:27,880
Zeng.

459
00:43:32,520 --> 00:43:33,840
It’s over, Zeng.

460
00:43:36,920 --> 00:43:37,920
Aren’t you tired, Inspector?

461
00:43:42,840 --> 00:43:43,240
Arrest him.

462
00:43:48,000 --> 00:43:48,400
Zeng.

463
00:43:51,160 --> 00:43:51,960
F*ck you, Zeng.

464
00:43:53,640 --> 00:43:55,200
Let's see how long
you can stay under the water, Zeng.

465
00:44:01,080 --> 00:44:01,600
This way.

466
00:44:01,600 --> 00:44:02,920
Come on. Grab it.

467
00:44:02,920 --> 00:44:03,480
Climb up.

468
00:44:03,960 --> 00:44:04,440
This way.

469
00:44:07,680 --> 00:44:09,080
Grab it.

470
00:44:09,240 --> 00:44:10,160
Grab it.

471
00:44:11,960 --> 00:44:13,280
Yes, grab it like that.

472
00:44:14,960 --> 00:44:15,440
Move.

473
00:44:16,160 --> 00:44:16,760
Zeng.

474
00:44:18,000 --> 00:44:19,840
Please don’t shoot me.

475
00:44:20,560 --> 00:44:22,120
I’m not a gangster. I’m just a temple boy.

476
00:44:23,320 --> 00:44:23,880
Don’t shoot me.

477
00:44:28,200 --> 00:44:29,320
Damn it.

478
00:44:29,520 --> 00:44:31,240
Stop it.

479
00:44:36,040 --> 00:44:38,040
Hongsen, you make me run myself ragged.

480
00:44:38,600 --> 00:44:39,080
You!

481
00:44:45,640 --> 00:44:46,200
Hurry up.

482
00:44:48,240 --> 00:44:48,680
Come on.

483
00:44:53,160 --> 00:44:54,800
What the heck?

484
00:44:56,800 --> 00:44:57,360
Follow them.

485
00:45:04,080 --> 00:45:04,680
Hide here.

486
00:45:13,880 --> 00:45:16,240
I saw them go into that alley. Hurry, check it out!

487
00:45:24,560 --> 00:45:25,880
Hey. Do you see them?

488
00:45:26,440 --> 00:45:27,480
No one is there.

489
00:45:28,200 --> 00:45:28,800
Where did they go?

490
00:45:28,960 --> 00:45:30,160
I saw them running this way.

491
00:45:31,720 --> 00:45:32,920
It’s okay. Let’s keep looking for them.

492
00:45:33,320 --> 00:45:33,680
Go.

493
00:45:55,400 --> 00:45:55,840
Hey.

494
00:45:57,080 --> 00:45:57,560
Hey.

495
00:45:58,640 --> 00:45:59,120
Hey.

496
00:46:00,680 --> 00:46:01,160
Hey.

497
00:46:03,960 --> 00:46:04,560
Father.

498
00:46:07,480 --> 00:46:08,320
Where am I?

499
00:46:26,400 --> 00:46:27,600
You did mouth-to-mouth on me.

500
00:46:30,960 --> 00:46:32,720
I will never forget that you saved my life.

501
00:46:40,560 --> 00:46:42,080
I’m still alive because of you.

502
00:46:57,400 --> 00:46:57,760
You!

503
00:47:18,760 --> 00:47:20,120
So you are a temple boy.

504
00:47:24,520 --> 00:47:25,440
Stop it.
Hey, stop it!

505
00:47:27,520 --> 00:47:28,200
What do you want?

506
00:47:30,880 --> 00:47:31,280
Nothing.

507
00:47:32,600 --> 00:47:33,280
It’s good that you live here.

508
00:47:34,200 --> 00:47:37,280
From now on, if Father needs anything,

509
00:47:38,120 --> 00:47:39,000
you need to tell me right away.

510
00:47:40,960 --> 00:47:41,280
Why?

511
00:47:42,000 --> 00:47:43,360
I will arrange it for him.

512
00:47:43,920 --> 00:47:45,120
He saved my life.

513
00:47:45,760 --> 00:47:47,000
I need to pay him back.

514
00:47:47,480 --> 00:47:48,960
He just helped you.

515
00:47:49,720 --> 00:47:50,920
He doesn’t expect anything in return.

516
00:47:52,280 --> 00:47:53,320
I have to pay him back.

517
00:47:53,920 --> 00:47:55,040
I don’t like owing anyone.

518
00:47:56,520 --> 00:47:59,280
You are a gangster.

519
00:47:59,600 --> 00:47:59,920
Yes.

520
00:48:00,920 --> 00:48:01,720
Now you know.

521
00:48:02,800 --> 00:48:04,160
Why did you ask so many questions?

522
00:48:04,680 --> 00:48:06,200
What if you owed me?

523
00:48:08,640 --> 00:48:10,120
Would you pay me back?

524
00:48:18,120 --> 00:48:20,200
Yes, but it’s unlikely.

525
00:48:21,160 --> 00:48:23,080
Because I…

526
00:48:27,080 --> 00:48:28,640
I will never need your help.

527
00:48:31,600 --> 00:48:32,560
Why are you laughing?

528
00:48:38,720 --> 00:48:41,640
If I help you
by telling you what Father needs,

529
00:48:43,000 --> 00:48:45,040
does it mean you owe me?

530
00:48:48,160 --> 00:48:49,360
You are so tricky.

531
00:48:53,880 --> 00:48:54,480
I’ll hire you.

532
00:49:07,680 --> 00:49:08,600
You’re such a pain in the ass.

533
00:49:14,200 --> 00:49:14,640
Hey.

534
00:49:39,960 --> 00:49:40,760
What is going on?

535
00:49:43,440 --> 00:49:44,080
Father.

536
00:49:45,680 --> 00:49:46,920
Please take care of him.

537
00:50:00,480 --> 00:50:01,360
Is he crazy?

538
00:50:11,760 --> 00:50:12,520
You hate gangsters.

539
00:50:14,400 --> 00:50:15,480
But you helped me twice.

540
00:50:16,200 --> 00:50:16,560
Thank you.

541
00:50:19,760 --> 00:50:20,360
I…

542
00:50:20,400 --> 00:50:21,400
Do you really hate gangsters?

543
00:50:25,640 --> 00:50:26,240
I don’t like them.

544
00:50:27,480 --> 00:50:28,520
But it doesn’t mean I won’t befriend them.

545
00:50:29,320 --> 00:50:29,800
It depends on the person.

546
00:50:38,840 --> 00:50:40,040
Are you a part of Zeng Klookfoon’s gang?

547
00:50:42,640 --> 00:50:43,080
Yes.

548
00:50:44,400 --> 00:50:45,080
I had a problem with them.

549
00:50:45,920 --> 00:50:46,560
So I ran away.

550
00:50:50,280 --> 00:50:50,720
What was the problem?

551
00:50:53,320 --> 00:50:54,440
It was about work.

552
00:50:55,400 --> 00:50:57,160
Nothing I did was good enough for my bro...

553
00:50:58,200 --> 00:50:59,600
Nothing I did was good enough for Big Bro…

554
00:51:00,440 --> 00:51:02,280
Nothing I did was good enough for Zeng.

555
00:51:03,280 --> 00:51:04,400
So I just ran away.

556
00:51:06,760 --> 00:51:07,160
Hey.

557
00:51:08,640 --> 00:51:10,200
Aren’t you going to give me anything in return?

558
00:51:10,480 --> 00:51:11,320
I saved your life.

559
00:51:13,160 --> 00:51:14,400
I thought you were a good person.

560
00:51:15,320 --> 00:51:16,360
You wouldn’t want anything in return.

561
00:51:17,520 --> 00:51:18,600
On the bus, you told me

562
00:51:19,320 --> 00:51:20,680
you didn’t want to owe anyone.

563
00:51:22,200 --> 00:51:25,640
On the bus, you told me
I needed to help myself first.

564
00:51:26,960 --> 00:51:27,360
Yes.

565
00:51:28,720 --> 00:51:29,520
That was then.

566
00:51:30,080 --> 00:51:31,760
But now, I want something in return.

567
00:51:32,320 --> 00:51:34,400
So you need to repay me.

568
00:51:39,080 --> 00:51:40,120
I want to join your gang.

569
00:51:44,520 --> 00:51:44,880
Huh?

570
00:51:48,920 --> 00:51:49,920
If I go back to Phra Nakorn,

571
00:51:50,920 --> 00:51:52,160
Zeng will beat me to death.

572
00:51:53,040 --> 00:51:54,240
I’ll be safe if I stay with you.

573
00:51:56,520 --> 00:51:57,400
I want to join your gang.

574
00:51:58,480 --> 00:51:59,240
I will work for you.

575
00:52:02,360 --> 00:52:04,160
Please let me join your gang, boss.

576
00:52:09,640 --> 00:52:10,240
Hey.

577
00:52:13,280 --> 00:52:14,560
You still owe me.

578
00:52:14,920 --> 00:52:15,560
You need to repay me.

579
00:52:17,160 --> 00:52:18,480
I don’t beat you up.

580
00:52:19,440 --> 00:52:21,000
That means I already repaid you.

581
00:52:23,400 --> 00:52:24,720
But I helped you twice.

582
00:52:26,880 --> 00:52:28,600
You repaid me by not beating me up
for the first help.

583
00:52:29,080 --> 00:52:29,880
You still owe me.

584
00:52:30,840 --> 00:52:31,800
You have to accept me into your gang.

585
00:52:40,080 --> 00:52:40,920
Will you take me in or not?

586
00:53:08,400 --> 00:53:09,600
Hong, can I have two of my usual?

587
00:53:15,520 --> 00:53:16,240
What the hell are you looking at?

588
00:53:17,360 --> 00:53:18,200
You, motherf*cker.

589
00:53:18,720 --> 00:53:19,320
Motherf*cker.

590
00:53:19,480 --> 00:53:20,800
What the f*ck is your problem?

591
00:53:20,920 --> 00:53:21,960
Asshole.

592
00:53:21,960 --> 00:53:23,640
Do you want me to throw you out?

593
00:53:24,600 --> 00:53:25,040
Sit down.

594
00:53:31,960 --> 00:53:33,960
Hongsen Gaoyod is the real deal.

595
00:53:34,680 --> 00:53:36,280
Zeng Klookfoon is formidable.

596
00:53:38,000 --> 00:53:39,920
Hongsen Gaoyod is so talented.

597
00:53:40,800 --> 00:53:43,000
Zeng Klookfoon is so scary.

598
00:53:44,360 --> 00:53:45,720
Hongsen is so manly.

599
00:53:45,840 --> 00:53:47,760
Zeng is so handsome.

600
00:53:48,440 --> 00:53:48,800
Ptuh!

601
00:53:49,360 --> 00:53:50,360
What the hell?

602
00:53:50,360 --> 00:53:51,440
What?

603
00:53:51,520 --> 00:53:52,360
Why?

604
00:53:52,800 --> 00:53:54,200
Bring it on.

605
00:53:55,160 --> 00:53:56,480
My soy milk.

606
00:53:57,560 --> 00:53:58,560
Sit down separately.

607
00:53:59,000 --> 00:53:59,440
Go.

608
00:53:59,600 --> 00:54:00,800
Go away.

609
00:54:00,800 --> 00:54:01,280
Go.

610
00:54:02,760 --> 00:54:04,280
Hello. My name is Yong.

611
00:54:04,760 --> 00:54:06,600
I’m a new member of Gaoyod Gang.

612
00:54:07,880 --> 00:54:10,840
Is your gang so poor that
you have to scare people to get a free meal?

613
00:54:11,560 --> 00:54:15,040
You have no right to huff and puff at my men.

614
00:54:15,720 --> 00:54:17,520
Aren’t there any temples in Phra Nakorn?

615
00:54:19,360 --> 00:54:20,840
My dad’s tomb is at this temple.

616
00:54:21,120 --> 00:54:23,040
Have you ever thought of apologizing to him?
